flowchart TD
    V[Simulated or watch vitals] --> S[Store timestamped sample with activity context]
    S --> R{Does an active rule match?}
    R -->|No| M[Continue monitoring]
    M --> V
    R -->|Yes| D[Watch LLM records condition and rationale]
    D --> T{Response tier}

    T -->|Tier 1: immediate threat| A[Log automatic injection event with cancel window and stock update]
    A --> C[Alert crew and manager agent]
    T -->|Tier 2: confirm first| P[Ask astronaut to confirm]
    P -->|Confirm| I[Log confirmed injection event]
    P -->|Cancel or decline| X[Cancel event and continue monitoring]
    T -->|Tier 3: crewmate action| N[Alert crewmate with response instructions]
    C --> E[Track event and response]
    I --> E
    X --> E
    N --> E

    subgraph Daily review
        SL[Overnight sleep] --> CI[Daily astronaut check-in]
        VH[Last 24 hours of vitals] --> CI
        MH[Mental health answers] --> CI
        CI --> RC[Manager agent analyzes root cause; astronaut report takes priority]
        RC --> TP[Create treatment plan]
        TP --> UR{Urgent?}
        UR -->|Yes| ACT[Proceed and log plan]
        UR -->|No| EARTH[Queue plan for mission command review]
    end

    E --> CI
    EARTH --> DELAY[Apply mission communication delay]
    DELAY --> REPLY[Receive mission command reply]
    REPLY --> CREW[Show instructions to crew]
    ACT --> CREW
    E --> REPORT[Create emergency report]
    CI --> WEEKLY[Create weekly crew summary]
    REPORT --> QUEUE[Queue report until Earth contact]
    WEEKLY --> QUEUE
